uential damage (2 HP left)."},{"round":2,"kind":"turn","key":"end_turn","reasoning":"End turn in Hero form. Rhino is stunned so his attack will be discarded."},{"round":2,"kind":"defend","key":"defend:none","reasoning":"Do not defend: we have Backflip in hand to prevent all damage if Rhino deals damage!"},{"round":2,"kind":"window","key":"play:Backflip","reasoning":"Play Backflip to take 0 damage from the attack."},{"round":3,"kind":"turn","key":"play:Jessica Jones|pay:Surveillance Team+The Power of Justice","reasoning":"Play Jessica Jones paying Surveillance Team and The Power of Justice (Justice card cost 3, Power of Justice counts as 2, Surveillance Team as 1). Jessica gets +1 THW for each side scheme in play."},{"round":3,"kind":"turn","key":"play:Web-Shooter|pay:Helicarrier","reasoning":"Play Web-Shooter paying Helicarrier."},{"round":3,"kind":"turn","key":"attack:Spider-Man\u003eRhino","reasoning":"Basic attack Rhino for 2 damage, defeating stage I! Stage II will enter with Breakin' \u0026 Takin'."},{"round":3,"kind":"turn","key":"thwart:Jessica Jones\u003eBreakin' \u0026 Takin'","reasoning":"Jessica Jones has THW 2 because Breakin' \u0026 Takin' is in play! Thwart Breakin' \u0026 Takin' for 2, reducing it to 1 threat. Mockingbird can thwart the remaining 1 threat to clear Breakin' \u0026 Takin' completely!"},{"round":3,"kind":"turn","key":"thwart:Mockingbird\u003eBreakin' \u0026 Takin'","reasoning":"Thwart Breakin' \u0026 Takin' with Mockingbird for 1, defeating the side scheme! This removes the Hazard icon."},{"round":3,"kind":"turn","key":"end_turn","reasoning":"End turn. We stay in hero form, ready all characters (Spider-Man, Jessica Jones, Mockingbird). We can use an ally to defend next attack, and Spider-Sense will trigger to draw a card."},{"round":3,"kind":"defend","key":"defend:Mockingbird","reasoning":"Defend with Mockingbird (she has 1 HP left, perfect chump block)."},{"round":4,"kind":"turn","key":"attack:Spider-Man\u003eSandman","reasoning":"Basic attack Sandman with Spider-Man to remove Sandman's Tough status. Spider-Man exhausts."},{"round":4,"kind":"turn","key":"play:Haymaker\u003eSandman|pay:First Aid+For Justice!","reasoning":"Play Haymaker targeting Sandman (3 damage, leaving Sandman at 1 HP), paying For Justice! and First Aid."},{"round":4,"kind":"turn","key":"play:Spider-Tracer\u003eSandman|pay:Great Responsibility","reasoning":"Play Spider-Tracer targeting Sandman paying Great Responsibility. When Sandman is defeated, remove 3 threat from a scheme!"},{"round":4,"kind":"turn","key":"attack:Jessica Jones\u003eSandman","reasoning":"Jessica Jones attacks Sandman for 2, defeating him! Spider-Tracer triggers to remove 3 threat from The Break-In!"},{"round":4,"kind":"choice","key":"effect:Spider-Tracer\u003eThe Break-In!","reasoning":"Remove threat from The Break-In! reducing it to 0."},{"round":4,"kind":"turn","key":"play:Aunt May|pay:Web-Shooter(ability)","reasoning":"Play Aunt May paying 1 counter from Web-Shooter. Aunt May is in play for future healing!"},{"round":4,"kind":"turn","key":"end_turn","reasoning":"End turn in Hero form. We have Jessica Jones at 1 HP to chump block Rhino's attack."},{"round":4,"kind":"defend","key":"defend:Jessica Jones","reasoning":"Defend with Jessica Jones (1 HP left). Spider-Man stays ready."},{"round":4,"kind":"window","key":"play:Enhanced Spider-Sense|pay:Web-Shooter(ability)","reasoning":"Cancel Shadow of the Past using Enhanced Spider-Sense paid with Web-Shooter! That cancels Vulture and Highway Robbery! Amazing!"},{"round":5,"kind":"turn","key":"play:Swinging Web Kick\u003eRhino|pay:Genius+Great Responsibility","reasoning":"Play Swinging Web Kick on Rhino (8 damage, down to 7 HP) paying Genius and Great Responsibility."},{"round":5,"kind":"turn","key":"attack:Spider-Man\u003eRhino","reasoning":"Basic attack Rhino for 2 damage (down to 5 HP). Spider-Man exhausts."},{"round":5,"kind":"turn","key":"play:Interrogation Room|pay:Black Cat","reasoning":"Play Interrogation Room paying Black Cat (or keep Black Cat? Wait, Black Cat costs 2, we have only 2 cards: Interrogation Room and Black Cat. Playing Black Cat requires 2 cards so we'd have to discard Interrogation Room, leaving 0 cards). Let's discard neither or play Interrogation Room. Actually, why not just end turn and draw 5 new cards? If we keep Black Cat, we only draw 4. Let's discard Black Cat or play Interrogation Room. Playing Interrogation Room gets a card onto the board."},{"round":5,"kind":"turn","key":"end_turn","reasoning":"End turn. Rhino has 5 HP left. We draw 5 cards. When Rhino attacks, Spider-Man has 10 HP (full!), DEF 3, and Spider-Sense draws 1 card."},{"round":5,"kind":"defend","key":"defend:none","reasoning":"Do not defend: we have 10 HP and in hand we already have Swinging Web Kick (deals 8 damage)! If Spider-Man is ready or exhausted, we can play Swinging Web Kick on our turn regardless because it's a Hero Action (attack), not a basic attack! But by not defending, we take the hit, we stay ready, and on our turn Swinging Web Kick + basic attack will be lethal regardless of guard minions. Rhino only has 5 HP left! Swinging Web Kick does 8 damage!"},{"round":6,"kind":"turn","key":"play:Swinging Web Kick\u003eRhino|pay:Heroic Intuition+Spider-Tracer+Web-Shooter","reasoning":"Play Swinging Web Kick on Rhino paying Spider-Tracer, Heroic Intuition, and Web-Shooter. Rhino has 5 HP, Swinging Web Kick deals 8 damage, defeating Rhino stage II and winning the game!"}],"log":["Setup: Spider-Man vs Rhino (The Break-In!).","Peter Parker draws 6 card(s).","Player chose: Mulligan: discard Interrogation Room (you draw back up to your hand size when you keep)","Player chose: Mulligan: discard Webbed Up (you draw back up to your hand size when you keep)","Player chose: Mulligan: discard Daredevil (you draw back up to your hand size when you keep)","Player chose: Keep this hand","Peter Parker draws 3 card(s).","--- Player turn, round 1 ---","Player chose: Play Heroic Intuition, paying: discard The Power of Justice [wild,wild]","Played Heroic Intuition.","Player chose: Play Nick Fury, paying: discard Energy [energy,energy]; discard For Justice! [energy]; use Peter Parker [mental]","Played Nick Fury.","Player chose: Draw 3 cards","Peter Parker draws 3 card(s).","Player chose: Change form to Spider-Man (once per turn)","Peter Parker changes form to Spider-Man.","Player chose: Play Swinging Web Kick targeting Rhino, paying: discard Emergency [energy]; discard Strength [physical,physical]","Played Swinging Web Kick.","Spider-Man attacks Rhino for 8.","Rhino takes 8 damage (6 HP left).","Player chose: Basic attack: Spider-Man deals 2 damage to Rhino (exhaust Spider-Man)","Spider-Man attacks Rhino for 2.","Rhino takes 2 damage (4 HP left).","Player chose: End your turn","Player chose: Done discarding; draw up to hand size","Spider-Man draws 4 card(s).","--- Villain phase, round 1 ---","1 threat placed on The Break-In! (now 1).","Spider-Man draws 1 card(s).","Rhino attacks Spider-Man.","Player chose: Defend with ally Nick Fury (exhaust; it takes all the damage, 3 HP left)","Boost card revealed: I'm Tough (+0).","Rhino's attack has 2 ATK.","Nick Fury takes 2 damage.","Encounter card revealed: Stampede (treachery).","Player chose: Play Enhanced Spider-Sense, paying: discard Surveillance Team [mental]","Played Enhanced Spider-Sense.","The When Revealed effect of Stampede is cancelled.","--- End of round. Round 2 begins ---","--- Player turn, round 2 ---","Player chose: Play Mockingbird, paying: discard Backflip [physical]; discard Webbed Up [physical]; discard Avengers Mansion [mental]","Played Mockingbird.","Player chose: Stun Rhino","Rhino is stunned.","Player chose: Basic attack: Spider-Man deals 2 damage to Rhino (exhaust Spider-Man)","Spider-Man attacks Rhino for 2.","Rhino takes 2 damage (2 HP left).","Player chose: Ally thwart: Mockingbird removes 1 threat from The Break-In! (exhaust; takes 1 consequential damage)","Mockingbird thwarts The Break-In! for 1.","1 threat removed from The Break-In! (now 0).","Mockingbird takes 1 damage.","Player chose: End your turn","Spider-Man draws 5 card(s).","--- Villain phase, round 2 ---","1 threat placed on The Break-In! (now 1).","Rhino is stunned: its attack is replaced by discarding the stun.","Encounter card revealed: Assault (treachery).","Spider-Man draws 1 card(s).","Rhino attacks Spider-Man.","Player chose: Do not defend (take the damage)","Boost card revealed: Caught Off Guard (+1).","Rhino's attack has 3 ATK.","Player chose: Play Backflip","Played Backflip.","--- End of round. Round 3 begins ---","--- Player turn, round 3 ---","Player chose: Play Jessica Jones, paying: discard Surveillance Team [mental]; discard The Power of Justice [wild,wild]","Played Jessica Jones.","Player chose: Play Web-Shooter, paying: discard Helicarrier [physical]","Played Web-Shooter.","Player chose: Basic attack: Spider-Man deals 2 damage to Rhino (exhaust Spider-Man)","Spider-Man attacks Rhino for 2.","Rhino takes 2 damage (0 HP left).","Villain stage defeated. Rhino advances to stage 01095 (15 HP).","Encounter card revealed: Breakin' \u0026 Takin' (side_scheme).","Side scheme Breakin' \u0026 Takin' enters play with 3 threat.","Player chose: Ally thwart: Jessica Jones removes 2 threat from Breakin' \u0026 Takin' (exhaust; takes 1 consequential damage)","Jessica Jones thwarts Breakin' \u0026 Takin' for 2.","2 threat removed from Breakin' \u0026 Takin' (now 1).","Jessica Jones takes 1 damage.","Player chose: Ally thwart: Mockingbird removes 1 threat from Breakin' \u0026 Takin' (exhaust; takes 1 consequential damage)","Mockingbird thwarts Breakin' \u0026 Takin' for 1.","1 threat removed from Breakin' \u0026 Takin' (now 0).","Breakin' \u0026 Takin' is defeated.","Mockingbird takes 1 damage.","Player chose: End your turn","Spider-Man draws 5 card(s).","--- Villain phase, round 3 ---","1 threat placed on The Break-In! (now 2).","Spider-Man draws 1 card(s).","Rhino attacks Spider-Man.","Player chose: Defend with ally Mockingbird (exhaust; it takes all the damage, 1 HP left)","Boost card revealed: Eviction Notice (+2).","Rhino's attack has 5 ATK.","Mockingbird takes 5 damage.","Mockingbird is defeated.","Encounter card revealed: Sandman (minion).","Sandman engages Spider-Man.","Sandman gains a tough status.","--- End of round. Round 4 begins ---","--- Player turn, round 4 ---","Player chose: Basic attack: Spider-Man deals 2 damage to Sandman (exhaust Spider-Man)","Spider-Man attacks Sandman for 2.","Sandman's tough status prevents the damage and is discarded.","Player chose: Play Haymaker targeting Sandman, paying: discard For Justice! [energy]; discard First Aid [mental]","Played Haymaker.","Spider-Man attacks Sandman for 3.","Sandman takes 3 damage (1 HP left).","Player chose: Play Spider-Tracer targeting Sandman, paying: discard Great Responsibility [mental]","Played Spider-Tracer.","Player chose: Ally attack: Jessica Jones deals 2 damage to Sandman (exhaust; takes 1 consequential damage)","Jessica Jones attacks Sandman for 2.","Sandman takes 2 damage (0 HP left).","Sandman is defeated.","Player chose: Remove 3 threat from The Break-In!","2 threat removed from The Break-In! (now 0).","Jessica Jones takes 1 damage.","Player chose: Play Aunt May, paying: use Web-Shooter [wild]","Played Aunt May.","Player chose: End your turn","Spider-Man draws 5 card(s).","--- Villain phase, round 4 ---","1 threat placed on The Break-In! (now 1).","Spider-Man draws 1 card(s).","Rhino attacks Spider-Man.","Player chose: Defend with ally Jessica Jones (exhaust; it takes all the damage, 1 HP left)","Boost card revealed: Explosion (+2).","Rhino's attack has 5 ATK.","Jessica Jones takes 5 damage.","Jessica Jones is defeated.","Encounter card revealed: Shadow of the Past (treachery).","Player chose: Play Enhanced Spider-Sense, paying: use Web-Shooter [wild]","Played Enhanced Spider-Sense.","The When Revealed effect of Shadow of the Past is cancelled.","--- End of round. Round 5 begins ---","--- Player turn, round 5 ---","Player chose: Play Swinging Web Kick targeting Rhino, paying: discard Genius [mental,mental]; discard Great Responsibility [mental]","Played Swinging Web Kick.","Spider-Man attacks Rhino for 8.","Rhino takes 8 damage (7 HP left).","Player chose: Basic attack: Spider-Man deals 2 damage to Rhino (exhaust Spider-Man)","Spider-Man attacks Rhino for 2.","Rhino takes 2 damage (5 HP left).","Player chose: Play Interrogation Room, paying: discard Black Cat [energy]","Played Interrogation Room.","Player chose: End your turn","Player deck reshuffled; an encounter card is dealt to Spider-Man.","Spider-Man draws 5 card(s).","--- Villain phase, round 5 ---","1 threat placed on The Break-In! (now 2).","Spider-Man draws 1 card(s).","Rhino attacks Spider-Man.","Player chose: Do not defend (take the damage)","Boost card revealed: Stampede (+1).","Rhino's attack has 4 ATK.","Spider-Man takes 4 damage (6 HP left).","Encounter card revealed: False Alarm (treachery).","Spider-Man is confused.","Encounter card revealed: Crowd Control (side_scheme).","Side scheme Crowd Control enters play with 2 threat.","--- End of round. Round 6 begins ---","--- Player turn, round 6 ---","Player chose: Play Swinging Web Kick targeting Rhino, paying: discard Spider-Tracer [energy]; discard Heroic Intuition [energy]; discard Web-Shooter [physical]","Played Swinging Web Kick.","Spider-Man attacks Rhino for 8.","Rhino takes 8 damage (0 HP left).","Rhino is defeated.","GAME OVER - victory: Rhino defeated"]}
