ing":"Change form to Spider-Man. In hero form, we can defend or use Backflip, draw from Spider-Sense, and prevent Rhino from scheming."},{"round":1,"kind":"turn","key":"attack:Spider-Man\u003eRhino","reasoning":"Basic attack Rhino for 2 damage. Threat is 0/7 so no need to basic thwart."},{"round":1,"kind":"turn","key":"end_turn","reasoning":"End turn. We hold Mockingbird, Backflip, Avengers Mansion. Hand size in hero form is 5, so we will draw 2 cards."},{"round":1,"kind":"discard","key":"discard:done","reasoning":"Done discarding. Keep Mockingbird, Backflip, Avengers Mansion. Draw 2 cards."},{"round":1,"kind":"defend","key":"defend:none","reasoning":"Do not defend: we have Backflip in hand to completely negate the damage if needed! Keeping Spider-Man ready is huge."},{"round":1,"kind":"window","key":"play:Backflip","reasoning":"Play Backflip to prevent all 3 damage!"},{"round":2,"kind":"turn","key":"attack:Black Cat\u003eHydra Mercenary","reasoning":"Attack Hydra Mercenary with Black Cat for 1 damage (reducing it to 2 HP). Black Cat takes no consequential damage."},{"round":2,"kind":"turn","key":"attack:Spider-Man\u003eHydra Mercenary","reasoning":"Basic attack Hydra Mercenary for 2 damage to defeat it. That clears Guard!"},{"round":2,"kind":"turn","key":"play:Avengers Mansion|pay:Emergency+Enhanced Spider-Sense+Mockingbird+Webbed Up","reasoning":"Play Avengers Mansion, paying with Mockingbird, Enhanced Spider-Sense, Emergency, and Webbed Up. Getting Avengers Mansion down early provides +1 card every turn for the rest of the game!"},{"round":2,"kind":"turn","key":"use:Avengers Mansion","reasoning":"Use Avengers Mansion to draw 1 card."},{"round":2,"kind":"turn","key":"end_turn","reasoning":"End turn. We stay in Hero form so Rhino attacks rather than schemes. Threat is only 1/7. We will draw 4 cards (+1 Interrogation Room in hand to make 5)."},{"round":2,"kind":"discard","key":"discard:Interrogation Room","reasoning":"Discard Interrogation Room, we don't need it right now and want a fresh 5 cards."},{"round":2,"kind":"window","key":"pass","reasoning":"Pass on Great Responsibility. 1 threat on 1/7 is totally fine."},{"round":2,"kind":"defend","key":"defend:Spider-Man","reasoning":"Defend with Spider-Man. DEF 3 will absorb most or all of Rhino's base 2 ATK (+ boost). We have full 10 HP and Aunt May in play. Exhausting is fine because we have Nick Fury and/or Swinging Web Kick to play on our turn."},{"round":2,"kind":"defend","key":"defend:none","reasoning":"Do not defend (Spider-Man is already exhausted, Black Cat should stay alive to attack/thwart). Spider-Man has 10 HP and Aunt May is ready for whenever we flip."},{"round":3,"kind":"turn","key":"use:Avengers Mansion","reasoning":"Use Avengers Mansion to draw a card first to see all available options."},{"round":3,"kind":"turn","key":"attack:Black Cat\u003eRhino","reasoning":"Attack Rhino with Black Cat for 1 damage (down to 10 HP). Black Cat takes 0 consequential damage on attack."},{"round":3,"kind":"turn","key":"play:Nick Fury|pay:Genius+Heroic Intuition+Spider-Tracer","reasoning":"Play Nick Fury paying with Genius and Spider-Tracer and Heroic Intuition. This gives us Nick Fury, who can draw 3 cards, deal 4 damage to Rhino, or thwart. Rhino is at 10 HP. If we deal 4 damage, he goes to 6 HP! Or we can draw 3 cards to dig for more. Let's see what options are best. Drawing 3 cards keeps high velocity."},{"round":3,"kind":"choice","key":"effect:Nick Fury\u003edraw","reasoning":"Draw 3 cards with Nick Fury. We still have Swinging Web Kick (deals 8 damage!) in hand!"},{"round":3,"kind":"turn","key":"attack:Nick Fury\u003eRhino","reasoning":"Nick Fury attacks Rhino for 2 damage (Rhino down to 8 HP). Consequential damage: 1 (Nick at 2 HP). Nick will block Rhino's attack later!"},{"round":3,"kind":"turn","key":"play:Swinging Web Kick\u003eRhino|pay:Great Responsibility+Heroic Intuition+Webbed Up","reasoning":"Swinging Web Kick deals 8 damage! Rhino stage 1 has exactly 8 HP left! That will defeat stage 1!\nPaying with Great Responsibility, Webbed Up, and Heroic Intuition.\nThen we can still play Helicarrier or Web-Shooter with our remaining cards! Wait, let's see which option pays what:\nWe have: Swinging Web Kick, Great Responsibility, Web-Shooter, Webbed Up, Helicarrier, The Power of Justice, Heroic Intuition.\nIf we play Helicarrier first: cost 3. Pay Webbed Up, Heroic Intuition, Great Responsibility. Then Helicarrier reduces SWK cost to 2!\nLet's see: can we play Helicarrier AND Web-Shooter AND SWK?\nHelicarrier cost 3: discard Webbed Up, The Power of Justice (generates 1 as non-Justice), and...\nWait, Helicarrier stays forever (+1 resource every round).\nOr just play Helicarrier paying Webbed Up, Great Responsibility, Heroic Intuition.\nThen Helicarrier exhausts to reduce SWK by 1.\nSWK costs 2. Discard The Power of Justice and Web-Shooter. SWK deals 8 damage and defeats Rhino stage 1!\nWait, if Rhino stage 1 is defeated, Rhino stage 2 appears: \"When revealed: find Breakin' \u0026 Takin' in the encounter deck or discard and reveal it; shuffle the encounter deck.\"\nBreakin' \u0026 Takin' gives an extra encounter card (hazard icon) and has 3 threat.\nLet's check if we can deal with that easily or if we should set up first.\nWith Helicarrier in play + Avengers Mansion in play + Aunt May in play, our board is completely maxed out!\nLet's play Helicarrier! Option 30: Helicarrier paying Great Responsibility, Webbed Up, Heroic Intuition."},{"round":3,"kind":"turn","key":"play:Web-Shooter|pay:The Power of Justice","reasoning":"Play Web-Shooter paying with The Power of Justice. We keep Helicarrier in hand to play next turn with full resources."},{"round":3,"kind":"turn","key":"end_turn","reasoning":"End turn. We stay in Hero form so Nick Fury can defend Rhino's attack (since Nick is discarded at end of round anyway!).\nWait, does Nick get discarded before or after villain phase? Rule: \"Discarded at the end of the round.\" The round ends after the villain phase! So Nick Fury can definitely defend against Rhino!"},{"round":3,"kind":"discard","key":"discard:done","reasoning":"Keep Helicarrier and draw up to hand size 5 (draw 4 cards)."},{"round":3,"kind":"window","key":"pass","reasoning":"Do not respond (pass on Great Responsibility). Main scheme threat goes to 3/7, well within safe limits."},{"round":3,"kind":"defend","key":"defend:Nick Fury","reasoning":"Defend with Nick Fury! Nick Fury is discarded at the end of the round anyway, so he takes the entire attack for free!"},{"round":3,"kind":"window","key":"play:Enhanced Spider-Sense|pay:Web-Shooter(ability)","reasoning":"Play Enhanced Spider-Sense using Web-Shooter to cancel Stampede! Stampede would make Rhino attack again and stun us. Canceling it completely avoids an entire villain attack!"},{"round":4,"kind":"turn","key":"use:Avengers Mansion","reasoning":"Use Avengers Mansion to draw a card first."},{"round":4,"kind":"turn","key":"attack:Black Cat\u003eShocker","reasoning":"Black Cat attacks Shocker for 1 damage (Shocker down to 2 HP). Black Cat takes no consequential damage."},{"round":4,"kind":"turn","key":"attack:Spider-Man\u003eShocker","reasoning":"Spider-Man basic attacks Shocker for 2 damage, defeating Shocker! Shocker is gone!"},{"round":4,"kind":"turn","key":"play:For Justice!\u003eBreakin' \u0026 Takin'|pay:Daredevil+Helicarrier","reasoning":"Play For Justice! targeting Breakin' \u0026 Takin' paying Helicarrier and Daredevil. Breakin' \u0026 Takin' has 3 threat and hazard icon, so For Justice! removes 3 threat, defeating it and getting rid of the Hazard icon!"},{"round":4,"kind":"turn","key":"end_turn","reasoning":"End turn. We stay in Hero form (Rhino will attack, drawing us 1 card with Spider-Sense). Threat is 3/7. We keep Swinging Web Kick in hand to hit Rhino next turn."},{"round":4,"kind":"discard","key":"discard:Great Responsibility","reasoning":"Discard Great Responsibility so we can draw more options. Keep Swinging Web Kick and Jessica Jones."},{"round":4,"kind":"discard","key":"discard:done","reasoning":"Done discarding. Draw 3 cards to reach hand size 5."},{"round":4,"kind":"defend","key":"defend:Spider-Man","reasoning":"Defend with Spider-Man (DEF 3). Spider-Man has 7 HP, so with DEF 3 he'll take very little or no damage, keeping Black Cat alive for attacking Rhino!"},{"round":5,"kind":"turn","key":"use:Avengers Mansion","reasoning":"Use Avengers Mansion to draw a card first."},{"round":5,"kind":"turn","key":"attack:Black Cat\u003eRhino","reasoning":"Black Cat attacks Rhino for 1 damage! (Rhino down to 14 HP).\nWait, look at our hand:\nWe have TWO Swinging Web Kicks!!\nSwinging Web Kick deals 8 damage each: 8 + 8 = 16 damage!\nRhino stage 2 currently has 15 HP!\nIf Black Cat attacks for 1: Rhino is at 14 HP.\nThen TWO Swinging Web Kicks deal 16 damage: 14 - 16 = -2 HP -\u003e Rhino is DEFEATED and we WIN THE GAME ON THE SPOT!\n\nLet's verify resources to play TWO Swinging Web Kicks:\nHand:\n- Swinging Web Kick (3)\n- Swinging Web Kick (3)\n- Strength (provides 2 physical resources!)\n- Jessica Jones (1)\n- Haymaker (1)\n- Tenacity (1)\n- First Aid (1)\n- Web-Shooter in play (2 counters, can exhaust for 1 wild resource)\n\nTotal resources needed for 2x SWK: 3 + 3 = 6 resources.\nWe have:\n- Strength (2)\n- Jessica Jones (1)\n-\u003e that pays 3 for the FIRST Swinging Web Kick!\nRemaining in hand:\n- Second Swinging Web Kick\n- Haymaker (1)\n- Tenacity (1)\n- First Aid (1)\nTotal resources = 3! Exactly enough to pay for the SECOND Swinging Web Kick!\n(And Web-Shooter is also available!)\n\nThis is an immediate, deterministic lethal win! Let's do it!"},{"round":5,"kind":"turn","key":"play:Swinging Web Kick\u003eRhino|pay:Jessica Jones+Strength","reasoning":"Play Swinging Web Kick targeting Rhino, paying with Jessica Jones and Strength (2 physical). This deals 8 damage to Rhino, taking Rhino from 14 HP down to 6 HP! Then we still have the second Swinging Web Kick in hand to finish him off!"},{"round":5,"kind":"turn","key":"play:Swinging Web Kick\u003eRhino|pay:First Aid+Haymaker+Tenacity","reasoning":"Play the second Swinging Web Kick targeting Rhino for 8 damage!\nPaying with Haymaker, Tenacity, and First Aid.\nRhino has 6 HP left, so 8 damage defeats Rhino's stage II and wins the game!"}],"log":["Setup: Spider-Man vs Rhino (The Break-In!).","Peter Parker draws 6 card(s).","Player chose: Mulligan: discard Spider-Tracer (you draw back up to your hand size when you keep)","Player chose: Mulligan: discard Interrogation Room (you draw back up to your hand size when you keep)","Player chose: Mulligan: discard Surveillance Team (you draw back up to your hand size when you keep)","Player chose: Keep this hand","Peter Parker draws 3 card(s).","--- Player turn, round 1 ---","Player chose: Play Aunt May, paying: use Peter Parker [mental]","Played Aunt May.","Player chose: Play Black Cat, paying: discard Web-Shooter [physical]; discard For Justice! [energy]","Played Black Cat.","Black Cat finds Avengers Mansion (added to hand).","Black Cat discards Energy.","Player chose: Ally attack: Black Cat deals 1 damage to Rhino (exhaust; takes 0 consequential damage)","Black Cat attacks Rhino for 1.","Rhino takes 1 damage (13 HP left).","Player chose: Change form to Spider-Man (once per turn)","Peter Parker changes form to Spider-Man.","Player chose: Basic attack: Spider-Man deals 2 damage to Rhino (exhaust Spider-Man)","Spider-Man attacks Rhino for 2.","Rhino takes 2 damage (11 HP left).","Player chose: End your turn","Player chose: Done discarding; draw up to hand size","Spider-Man draws 2 card(s).","--- Villain phase, round 1 ---","1 threat placed on The Break-In! (now 1).","Spider-Man draws 1 card(s).","Rhino attacks Spider-Man.","Player chose: Do not defend (take the damage)","Boost card revealed: Caught Off Guard (+1).","Rhino's attack has 3 ATK.","Player chose: Play Backflip","Played Backflip.","Encounter card revealed: Hydra Mercenary (minion).","Hydra Mercenary engages Spider-Man.","--- End of round. Round 2 begins ---","--- Player turn, round 2 ---","Player chose: Ally attack: Black Cat deals 1 damage to Hydra Mercenary (exhaust; takes 0 consequential damage)","Black Cat attacks Hydra Mercenary for 1.","Hydra Mercenary takes 1 damage (2 HP left).","Player chose: Basic attack: Spider-Man deals 2 damage to Hydra Mercenary (exhaust Spider-Man)","Spider-Man attacks Hydra Mercenary for 2.","Hydra Mercenary takes 2 damage (0 HP left).","Hydra Mercenary is defeated.","Player chose: Play Avengers Mansion, paying: discard Mockingbird [physical]; discard Enhanced Spider-Sense [mental]; discard Emergency [energy]; discard Webbed Up [physical]","Played Avengers Mansion.","Player chose: Use Avengers Mansion: draw 1 card (exhaust)","Spider-Man draws 1 card(s).","Player chose: End your turn","Player chose: Discard Interrogation Room from hand","Spider-Man draws 5 card(s).","--- Villain phase, round 2 ---","Player chose: Do not respond","1 threat placed on The Break-In! (now 2).","Spider-Man draws 1 card(s).","Rhino attacks Spider-Man.","Player chose: Defend with Spider-Man (exhaust; DEF 3 reduces the damage)","Boost card revealed: Hydra Bomber (+1).","Rhino's attack has 3 ATK.","Spider-Man defends, reducing the damage by 3.","Encounter card revealed: Gang-Up (treachery).","Spider-Man draws 1 card(s).","Rhino attacks Spider-Man.","Player chose: Do not defend (take the damage)","Boost card revealed: Advance (+0).","Rhino's attack has 2 ATK.","Spider-Man takes 2 damage (8 HP left).","--- End of round. Round 3 begins ---","--- Player turn, round 3 ---","Player chose: Use Avengers Mansion: draw 1 card (exhaust)","Spider-Man draws 1 card(s).","Player chose: Ally attack: Black Cat deals 1 damage to Rhino (exhaust; takes 0 consequential damage)","Black Cat attacks Rhino for 1.","Rhino takes 1 damage (10 HP left).","Player chose: Play Nick Fury, paying: discard Spider-Tracer [energy]; discard Genius [mental,mental]; discard Heroic Intuition [energy]","Played Nick Fury.","Player chose: Draw 3 cards","Spider-Man draws 3 card(s).","Player chose: Ally attack: Nick Fury deals 2 damage to Rhino (exhaust; takes 1 consequential damage)","Nick Fury attacks Rhino for 2.","Rhino takes 2 damage (8 HP left).","Nick Fury takes 1 damage.","Player chose: Play Swinging Web Kick targeting Rhino, paying: discard Great Responsibility [mental]; discard Webbed Up [physical]; discard Heroic Intuition [energy]","Played Swinging Web Kick.","Spider-Man attacks Rhino for 8.","Rhino takes 8 damage (0 HP left).","Villain stage defeated. Rhino advances to stage 01095 (15 HP).","Encounter card revealed: Breakin' \u0026 Takin' (side_scheme).","Side scheme Breakin' \u0026 Takin' enters play with 3 threat.","Player chose: Play Web-Shooter, paying: discard The Power of Justice [wild]","Played Web-Shooter.","Player chose: End your turn","Player chose: Done discarding; draw up to hand size","Spider-Man draws 4 card(s).","--- Villain phase, round 3 ---","Player chose: Do not respond","1 threat placed on The Break-In! (now 3).","Spider-Man draws 1 card(s).","Rhino attacks Spider-Man.","Player chose: Defend with ally Nick Fury (exhaust; it takes all the damage, 2 HP left)","Boost card revealed: Shadow of the Past (+2).","Rhino's attack has 5 ATK.","Nick Fury takes 5 damage.","Nick Fury is defeated.","Encounter card revealed: Stampede (treachery).","Player chose: Play Enhanced Spider-Sense, paying: use Web-Shooter [wild]","Played Enhanced Spider-Sense.","The When Revealed effect of Stampede is cancelled.","Encounter card revealed: Shocker (minion).","Shocker engages Spider-Man.","Spider-Man takes 1 damage (7 HP left).","--- End of round. Round 4 begins ---","--- Player turn, round 4 ---","Player chose: Use Avengers Mansion: draw 1 card (exhaust)","Spider-Man draws 1 card(s).","Player chose: Ally attack: Black Cat deals 1 damage to Shocker (exhaust; takes 0 consequential damage)","Black Cat attacks Shocker for 1.","Shocker takes 1 damage (2 HP left).","Player chose: Basic attack: Spider-Man deals 2 damage to Shocker (exhaust Spider-Man)","Spider-Man attacks Shocker for 2.","Shocker takes 2 damage (0 HP left).","Shocker is defeated.","Player chose: Play For Justice! targeting Breakin' \u0026 Takin', paying: discard Helicarrier [physical]; discard Daredevil [physical]","Played For Justice!.","Spider-Man thwarts Breakin' \u0026 Takin' for 3.","3 threat removed from Breakin' \u0026 Takin' (now 0).","Breakin' \u0026 Takin' is defeated.","Player chose: End your turn","Player chose: Discard Great Responsibility from hand","Player chose: Done discarding; draw up to hand size","Spider-Man draws 3 card(s).","--- Villain phase, round 4 ---","1 threat placed on The Break-In! (now 4).","Spider-Man draws 1 card(s).","Rhino attacks Spider-Man.","Player chose: Defend with Spider-Man (exhaust; DEF 3 reduces the damage)","Boost card revealed: Hydra Mercenary (+1).","Rhino's attack has 4 ATK.","Spider-Man defends, reducing the damage by 3.","Spider-Man takes 1 damage (6 HP left).","Encounter card revealed: Crowd Control (side_scheme).","Side scheme Crowd Control enters play with 2 threat.","--- End of round. Round 5 begins ---","--- Player turn, round 5 ---","Player chose: Use Avengers Mansion: draw 1 card (exhaust)","Spider-Man draws 1 card(s).","Player chose: Ally attack: Black Cat deals 1 damage to Rhino (exhaust; takes 0 consequential damage)","Black Cat attacks Rhino for 1.","Rhino takes 1 damage (14 HP left).","Player chose: Play Swinging Web Kick targeting Rhino, paying: discard Jessica Jones [energy]; discard Strength [physical,physical]","Played Swinging Web Kick.","Spider-Man attacks Rhino for 8.","Rhino takes 8 damage (6 HP left).","Player chose: Play Swinging Web Kick targeting Rhino, paying: discard Haymaker [energy]; discard Tenacity [energy]; discard First Aid [mental]","Played Swinging Web Kick.","Spider-Man attacks Rhino for 8.","Rhino takes 8 damage (0 HP left).","Rhino is defeated.","GAME OVER - victory: Rhino defeated"]}
