ys, so removes 4 threat!)"},{"round":4,"kind":"turn","key":"attack:Jessica Jones\u003eVulture","reasoning":"Ally attack: Jessica Jones deals 2 damage to Vulture"},{"round":4,"kind":"turn","key":"change_form:Peter Parker","reasoning":"Change form to Peter Parker"},{"round":4,"kind":"turn","key":"play:Mockingbird|pay:Great Responsibility+Great Responsibility+Peter Parker(ability)","reasoning":"Play Mockingbird paying with Great Responsibility, Great Responsibility, and Peter Parker's mental ability"},{"round":4,"kind":"choice","key":"effect:Mockingbird\u003eRhino","reasoning":"Stun Rhino (disables Rhino's next attack with Charge!)"},{"round":4,"kind":"turn","key":"attack:Mockingbird\u003eVulture","reasoning":"Ally attack: Mockingbird deals 1 damage to Vulture (leaving Vulture at 1 HP)"},{"round":4,"kind":"turn","key":"end_turn","reasoning":"End turn"},{"round":4,"kind":"discard","key":"discard:done","reasoning":"Done discarding; keep Haymaker and draw up to 6"},{"round":5,"kind":"turn","key":"attack:Mockingbird\u003eVulture","reasoning":"Ally attack: Mockingbird deals 1 damage to Vulture, defeating Vulture! Interrogation Room removes 1 threat from The Break-In!"},{"round":5,"kind":"choice","key":"effect:Interrogation Room\u003eThe Break-In!","reasoning":"Remove 1 threat from The Break-In!"},{"round":5,"kind":"turn","key":"thwart:Jessica Jones\u003eThe Break-In!","reasoning":"Ally thwart: Jessica Jones removes 1 threat from The Break-In!"},{"round":5,"kind":"turn","key":"change_form:Spider-Man","reasoning":"Change form to Spider-Man"},{"round":5,"kind":"turn","key":"use:Helicarrier","reasoning":"Use Helicarrier to discount next card by 1"},{"round":5,"kind":"turn","key":"attack:Spider-Man\u003eRhino","reasoning":"Basic attack: Spider-Man deals 2 damage to Rhino (Rhino has 10 HP, becomes 8 HP)"},{"round":5,"kind":"turn","key":"play:Swinging Web Kick\u003eRhino|pay:Strength","reasoning":"Play Swinging Web Kick targeting Rhino (cost 2 due to Helicarrier), paying with Strength (2 physical). Deals 8 damage, defeating Rhino Stage 1!"},{"round":5,"kind":"turn","key":"play:Haymaker\u003eRhino|pay:Enhanced Spider-Sense+Web-Shooter(ability)","reasoning":"Play Haymaker targeting Rhino, paying with Enhanced Spider-Sense and Web-Shooter"},{"round":5,"kind":"turn","key":"end_turn","reasoning":"End turn"},{"round":5,"kind":"discard","key":"discard:done","reasoning":"Done discarding, draw up to 5"},{"round":5,"kind":"choice","key":"effect:Caught Off Guard\u003eInterrogation Room","reasoning":"Discard Interrogation Room (already used, and minions are mostly gone)"},{"round":6,"kind":"turn","key":"thwart:Spider-Man\u003eThe Break-In!","reasoning":"Basic thwart: Spider-Man removes 1 threat from The Break-In!"},{"round":6,"kind":"turn","key":"use:Helicarrier","reasoning":"Use Helicarrier to discount next card by 1"},{"round":6,"kind":"turn","key":"play:Webbed Up\u003eRhino|pay:Tenacity+The Power of Justice+Web-Shooter(ability)","reasoning":"Play Webbed Up targeting Rhino (cost 3 with Helicarrier discount), paying with Power of Justice, Tenacity, and Web-Shooter. Keep Backflip in hand!"},{"round":6,"kind":"turn","key":"thwart:Mockingbird\u003eThe Break-In!","reasoning":"Mockingbird thwarts The Break-In! for 1, reducing threat to 3 (Mockingbird is defeated by consequential damage)"},{"round":6,"kind":"turn","key":"end_turn","reasoning":"End turn. Stay in Hero form, Rhino is Webbed Up!"},{"round":6,"kind":"discard","key":"discard:Avengers Mansion","reasoning":"Discard Avengers Mansion, keep Backflip, draw up to 5"},{"round":6,"kind":"discard","key":"discard:done","reasoning":"Done discarding; draw up to hand size"},{"round":7,"kind":"turn","key":"use:Helicarrier","reasoning":"Use Helicarrier to discount next card by 1"},{"round":7,"kind":"turn","key":"play:Heroic Intuition|pay:Spider-Tracer","reasoning":"Play Heroic Intuition paying with Spider-Tracer"},{"round":7,"kind":"turn","key":"play:Web-Shooter|pay:Spider-Tracer","reasoning":"Play Web-Shooter pa