{"run_id":"20261016T161041Z","scenario":"spider-man-vs-rhino","player":"model:gemini-3.8-flash-high","instructions":{"names":["rules"],"sha256":"51f76cb90b2add15"},"seed":5,"sample":0,"status":"won","rounds":6,"decisions":59,"stats":{"allies":2,"decisions":59,"hand":0,"hero_hp":2,"hero_max_hp":10,"lost":0,"main_target":7,"main_threat":3,"minions":0,"over":1,"round":6,"side_schemes":0,"side_threat":0,"villain_damage":29,"villain_hp":0,"villain_hp_total":0,"villain_total_hp":29,"won":1},"criteria":{"hero_hp":0.2,"speed":0.75,"threat":0.5714285714285714,"villain_damage":1,"win":1},"score":0.8396428571428571,"usage":{"requests":69,"input_tokens":1670846,"output_tokens":7263,"cached_tokens":1334135},"ms":226549,"choices":[{"round":1,"kind":"mulligan","key":"mulligan:For Justice!","reasoning":"Mulligan For Justice! since there is no threat on the scheme turn 1."},{"round":1,"kind":"mulligan","key":"mulligan:For Justice!","reasoning":"Discard second For Justice!"},{"round":1,"kind":"mulligan","key":"mulligan:Swinging Web Kick","reasoning":"Discard Swinging Web Kick"},{"round":1,"kind":"mulligan","key":"mulligan:Backflip","reasoning":"Discard one Backflip"},{"round":1,"kind":"mulligan","key":"mulligan:keep","reasoning":"Keep Avengers Mansion and one Backflip, draw 4 cards."},{"round":1,"kind":"turn","key":"play:Avengers Mansion|pay:Genius+Peter Parker(ability)+Webbed Up","reasoning":"Play Avengers Mansion using Peter Parker's ability, Genius (2), and Webbed Up (1), keeping Backflip, Great Responsibility, and The Power of Justice. Wait, let's keep Backflip! Option 14 discards Genius and Webbed Up, uses Peter Parker ability. Cost = 4. Backflip (0-cost defense) is retained."},{"round":1,"kind":"turn","key":"use:Avengers Mansion","reasoning":"Use Avengers Mansion to draw a card"},{"round":1,"kind":"turn","key":"play:Black Cat|pay:Great Responsibility+The Power of Justice","reasoning":"Play Black Cat paying Great Responsibility and The Power of Justice, keeping Backflip in hand."},{"round":1,"kind":"turn","key":"attack:Black Cat\u003eRhino","reasoning":"Black Cat attacks Rhino for 1 damage (takes 0 consequential damage on attack!)."},{"round":1,"kind":"turn","key":"change_form:Spider-Man","reasoning":"Change form to Spider-Man."},{"round":1,"kind":"turn","key":"attack:Spider-Man\u003eRhino","reasoning":"Basic attack Rhino for 2 damage."},{"round":1,"kind":"turn","key":"end_turn","reasoning":"End turn with Backflip in hand. Spider-Man will ready, draw up to 5, draw another card when Rhino attacks (Spider-Sense), and can Backflip Rhino's attack."},{"round":1,"kind":"discard","key":"discard:done","reasoning":"Done discarding, keep Backflip."},{"round":1,"kind":"defend","key":"defend:none","reasoning":"Do not defend; we have Backflip in hand to cancel all damage if needed."},{"round":1,"kind":"window","key":"play:Backflip","reasoning":"Play Backflip to prevent all 2 damage!"},{"round":1,"kind":"choice","key":"effect:Hydra Bomber\u003edamage","reasoning":"Take 2 damage (Spider-Man is at 10/10 HP, main scheme threshold is low at 7, so taking 2 damage is safer)."},{"round":2,"kind":"turn","key":"use:Avengers Mansion","reasoning":"Use Avengers Mansion to draw a card first."},{"round":2,"kind":"turn","key":"attack:Spider-Man\u003eHydra Bomber","reasoning":"Kill Hydra Bomber with Spider-Man basic attack (2 ATK defeats Hydra Bomber 2 HP)."},{"round":2,"kind":"turn","key":"attack:Black Cat\u003eRhino","reasoning":"Black Cat attacks Rhino for 1 damage."},{"round":2,"kind":"turn","key":"play:Jessica Jones|pay:Heroic Intuition+Strength","reasoning":"Play Jessica Jones, paying Strength and Heroic Intuition. Then we still have Aunt May, First Aid, Surveillance Team. Wait, Aunt May costs 1, First Aid costs 1, Surveillance Team costs 2. Let's see what cards remain. Jessica Jones is great for board presence/chump blocking if needed. Let's play Jessica Jones!"},{"round":2,"kind":"turn","key":"play:Aunt May|pay:Surveillance Team","reasoning":"Play Aunt May paying Surveillance Team. Aunt May is permanent support for recovery later."},{"round":2,"kind":"turn","key":"thwart:Jessica Jones\u003eThe Break-In!","reasoning":"Jessica Jones thwarts The Break-In! removing 1 threat (down to 0 threat). Takes 1 consequential damage."},{"round":2,"kind":"turn","key":"end_turn","reasoning":"Stay in hero form (8 HP, Rhino stage 1 has 10 HP left, threat is at 0, we have First Aid in hand or can discard it, will draw 5 cards + 1 from Spider-Sense). End turn."},{"round":2,"kind":"discard","key":"discard:First Aid","reasoning":"Discard First Aid so we draw a fresh hand of 5."},{"round":2,"kind":"window","key":"pass","reasoning":"Do not respond (threat is only going from 0 to 1)."},{"round":2,"kind":"defend","key":"defend:Jessica Jones","reasoning":"Defend with Jessica Jones (takes the hit so Spider-Man stays ready and at high HP)."},{"round":2,"kind":"window","key":"pass","reasoning":"Do not respond (let False Alarm confuse us, no need to waste Enhanced Spider-Sense on a simple confuse when threat is low)."},{"round":3,"kind":"turn","key":"use:Avengers Mansion","reasoning":"Use Avengers Mansion to draw 1 card."},{"round":3,"kind":"turn","key":"thwart:Spider-Man\u003eThe Break-In!","reasoning":"Basic thwart to clear confuse status (Spider-Man exhausts, clearing confused). Wait, or do we want Spider-Man to attack? Spider-Man basic attack is 2 damage. But clearing confuse with basic thwart is free threat management later. Wait, Black Cat can thwart or attack, let's see. If Spider-Man attacks, Rhino takes 2. Let's look at Webbed Up vs Mockingbird.\nMockingbird stuns Rhino when entering play! And can thwart/attack and defend.\nMockingbird costs 3. Web-Shooter costs 1.\nLet's play Mockingbird and Web-Shooter!\nWait, can Spider-Man clear confuse by basic thwarting? Yes option 1 is \"Basic thwart: Spider-Man removes 1 threat (you are confused: this only removes the confuse)\". But if Spider-Man basic attacks Rhino, Rhino takes 2 damage! Rhino is at 10 HP. Why clear confuse by exhausting Spider-Man when Spider-Man could deal 2 damage? Threat is currently only 1/7. Black Cat can thwart 1 threat if needed, or deal 1 damage.\nWait, let's play Mockingbird! Mockingbird stuns Rhino.\nLet's see option 38: \"Play Mockingbird, paying: discard Great Responsibility, Webbed Up, Spider-Tracer\". Mockingbird enters and stuns Rhino.\nThen play Web-Shooter paying Interrogation Room (cost 1).\nThen keep Enhanced Spider-Sense for treachery defense!\nWait, let's check what Web-Shooter costs: 1 resource.\nLet's play Mockingbird first!"},{"round":3,"kind":"turn","key":"play:Mockingbird|pay:Great Responsibility+Spider-Tracer+Webbed Up","reasoning":"Play Mockingbird, paying Great Responsibility, Spider-Tracer, Webbed Up. Mockingbird enters and stuns Rhino."},{"round":3,"kind":"choice","key":"effect:Mockingbird\u003eRhino","reasoning":"Stun Rhino!"},{"round":3,"kind":"turn","key":"play:Web-Shooter|pay:Interrogation Room","reasoning":"Play Web-Shooter, paying Interrogation Room. Keeping Enhanced Spider-Sense for treachery interrupt."},{"round":3,"kind":"turn","key":"attack:Black Cat\u003eRhino","reasoning":"Ally attack: Black Cat deals 1 damage to Rhino (takes 0 consequential damage)."},{"round":3,"kind":"turn","key":"thwart:Mockingbird\u003eThe Break-In!","reasoning":"Mockingbird thwarts The Break-In! removing 1 threat (now 0 threat). Takes 1 damage (2 HP left)."},{"round":3,"kind":"turn","key":"end_turn","reasoning":"End turn in hero form. Rhino is stunned so attack will be cancelled. We hold Enhanced Spider-Sense. We will draw 4 cards."},{"round":3,"kind":"discard","key":"discard:done","reasoning":"Keep Enhanced Spider-Sense. Draw up to hand size."},{"round":3,"kind":"window","key":"play:Enhanced Spider-Sense|pay:Web-Shooter(ability)","reasoning":"Cancel Assault using Web-Shooter counter! This avoids Rhino attacking us."},{"round":4,"kind":"turn","key":"use:Avengers Mansion","reasoning":"Use Avengers Mansion to draw a card first."},{"round":4,"kind":"turn","key":"attack:Black Cat\u003eRhino","reasoning":"Black Cat attacks Rhino for 1 damage (down to 8 HP)."},{"round":4,"kind":"turn","key":"play:Swinging Web Kick\u003eRhino|pay:Haymaker+Helicarrier+Web-Shooter","reasoning":"Play Swinging Web Kick on Rhino dealing 8 damage! This defeats Rhino stage 1 (8 HP left). Paying Helicarrier, Web-Shooter, Haymaker. Option 15 keeps Enhanced Spider-Sense. Wait, what about playing Helicarrier instead and chipping Rhino? If we advance Rhino now to Stage 2:\nStage 2 Rhino has 15 HP and When Revealed: find Breakin' \u0026 Takin' in the encounter deck or discard and reveal it. Breakin' \u0026 Takin' is a side scheme with 2 threat + hazard icon!\nMockingbird can thwart it or attack. Spider-Man hasn't acted yet this turn!\nIf we advance Rhino to stage 2:\nSwinging Web Kick deals 8, defeats Stage 1.\nStage 2 enters with 15 HP, Breakin' \u0026 Takin' enters.\nSpider-Man can basic attack Rhino for 2 (down to 13) or basic thwart Breakin' \u0026 Takin'.\nMockingbird can thwart Breakin' \u0026 Takin' (2 threat removed, defeating Breakin' \u0026 Takin'!).\nWait, let's verify Breakin' \u0026 Takin' starting threat! Let's check card Breakin' \u0026 Takin'."},{"round":4,"kind":"turn","key":"thwart:Spider-Man\u003eBreakin' \u0026 Takin'","reasoning":"Basic thwart Breakin' \u0026 Takin' with Spider-Man to remove 1 threat (down to 2)."},{"round":4,"kind":"turn","key":"thwart:Mockingbird\u003eBreakin' \u0026 Takin'","reasoning":"Mockingbird thwarts Breakin' \u0026 Takin' removing 1 threat (down to 1). Mockingbird takes 1 consequential damage (1 HP left). Mockingbird can chump block Rhino's attack next turn!"},{"round":4,"kind":"turn","key":"end_turn","reasoning":"End turn. Spider-Man has 8 HP, Mockingbird ready to defend (or exhausted, wait: at end of player turn all exhausted player cards READY!). So Mockingbird, Black Cat, Spider-Man, Avengers Mansion all ready! Enhanced Spider-Sense is in hand."},{"round":4,"kind":"discard","key":"discard:done","reasoning":"Keep Enhanced Spider-Sense, draw up to hand size 5."},{"round":4,"kind":"defend","key":"defend:Mockingbird","reasoning":"Defend with Mockingbird (she has 1 HP left, perfect chump block, keeps Spider-Man ready with 8 HP)."},{"round":4,"kind":"window","key":"pass","reasoning":"Do not respond (Bomb Scare is not in play, so it just surges to another encounter card). Let's save Enhanced Spider-Sense for a real bad treachery or resources."},{"round":5,"kind":"turn","key":"use:Avengers Mansion","reasoning":"Use Avengers Mansion to draw a card."},{"round":5,"kind":"turn","key":"thwart:Black Cat\u003eBreakin' \u0026 Takin'","reasoning":"Black Cat thwarts Breakin' \u0026 Takin' removing the last 1 threat, defeating the side scheme! Black Cat takes 1 damage (1 HP left). Hazard icon is gone!"},{"round":5,"kind":"turn","key":"attack:Spider-Man\u003eRhino","reasoning":"Spider-Man basic attack Rhino for 2 damage (Rhino down to 13 HP)."},{"round":5,"kind":"turn","key":"play:Swinging Web Kick\u003eRhino|pay:Emergency+Energy","reasoning":"Play Swinging Web Kick on Rhino dealing 8 damage (Rhino down to 5 HP!). Paying Emergency and Energy."},{"round":5,"kind":"turn","key":"play:Heroic Intuition|pay:Interrogation Room+Surveillance Team","reasoning":"Play Heroic Intuition, paying Surveillance Team and Interrogation Room. Keeping Enhanced Spider-Sense for treachery defense!"},{"round":5,"kind":"turn","key":"end_turn","reasoning":"End turn. Spider-Man has 8 HP, Black Cat has 1 HP (ready to chump block or attack next turn). Rhino has only 5 HP left! Web-Shooter has 2 counters. Enhanced Spider-Sense in hand. We will draw 4 cards + 1 from Spider-Sense when Rhino attacks."},{"round":5,"kind":"discard","key":"discard:done","reasoning":"Keep Enhanced Spider-Sense, done discarding."},{"round":5,"kind":"defend","key":"defend:Spider-Man","reasoning":"Defend with Spider-Man!\nWait: Rhino has ATK 7 (3 base + 3 Charge + 1 Ivory Horn) + boost card!\nIf Black Cat defends, Charge has overkill! 7 + boost - 1 (Black Cat HP) = 6+ damage to Spider-Man! Spider-Man has 8 HP, so 6+ boost could kill Spider-Man!\nIf Spider-Man defends: DEF is 3. 7 + boost - 3 = 4 + boost damage to Spider-Man. Spider-Man survives unless boost is 4 (maximum boost in Rhino deck is 3!).\nWait, do we have Backflip? No, Backflip was shuffled into the deck.\nSo defending with Spider-Man takes DEF 3 off the total! 7 + boost - 3 = 4 + boost.\nIf Black Cat defends, Black Cat has 1 HP, overkill damage deals 7 + boost - 1 = 6 + boost to Spider-Man!\nTherefore, defending with Spider-Man takes LESS damage than defending with Black Cat due to Overkill!\nLet's defend with Spider-Man!"},{"round":5,"kind":"window","key":"play:Enhanced Spider-Sense|pay:Web-Shooter(ability)","reasoning":"Cancel Hard to Keep Down using Web-Shooter!\nIf Rhino healed 4 damage, he would be at 9 HP instead of 5 HP!\nCancelling it keeps Rhino at 5 HP!\nWe can easily deal 5 damage this turn to WIN THE GAME!\nNick Fury deals 4 damage when entering play, and Black Cat attacks for 1 = 5 damage = RHINO DEFEATED = VICTORY!\nLet's cancel Hard to Keep Down with Enhanced Spider-Sense using Web-Shooter!"},{"round":6,"kind":"turn","key":"attack:Black Cat\u003eRhino","reasoning":"Black Cat attacks Rhino for 1 damage! (Rhino down to 4 HP)."},{"round":6,"kind":"turn","key":"play:Nick Fury|pay:Daredevil+Spider-Tracer+The Power of Justice+Webbed Up","reasoning":"Play Nick Fury, paying Spider-Tracer, Daredevil, Webbed Up, The Power of Justice! Nick Fury's \"When he enters play\" ability lets us deal 4 damage to an enemy! That will deal 4 damage to Rhino, reducing Rhino to 0 HP and winning the game!"},{"round":6,"kind":"choice","key":"effect:Nick Fury\u003edamage","reasoning":"Deal 4 damage to an enemy!"},{"round":6,"kind":"choice","key":"effect:Nick Fury\u003eRhino","reasoning":"Deal 4 damage to Rhino to defeat Stage 2 and win!"}],"log":["Setup: Spider-Man vs Rhino (The Break-In!).","Peter Parker draws 6 card(s).","P