n, round 2 ---","Player chose: Use Avengers Mansion: draw 1 card (exhaust)","Spider-Man draws 1 card(s).","Player chose: Basic attack: Spider-Man deals 2 damage to Hydra Bomber (exhaust Spider-Man)","Spider-Man attacks Hydra Bomber for 2.","Hydra Bomber takes 2 damage (0 HP left).","Hydra Bomber is defeated.","Player chose: Ally attack: Black Cat deals 1 damage to Rhino (exhaust; takes 0 consequential damage)","Black Cat attacks Rhino for 1.","Rhino takes 1 damage (10 HP left).","Player chose: Play Jessica Jones, paying: discard Heroic Intuition [energy]; discard Strength [physical,physical]","Played Jessica Jones.","Player chose: Play Aunt May, paying: discard Surveillance Team [mental]","Played Aunt May.","Player chose: Ally thwart: Jessica Jones removes 1 threat from The Break-In! (exhaust; takes 1 consequential damage)","Jessica Jones thwarts The Break-In! for 1.","1 threat removed from The Break-In! (now 0).","Jessica Jones takes 1 damage.","Player chose: End your turn","Player chose: Discard First Aid from hand","Spider-Man draws 5 card(s).","--- Villain phase, round 2 ---","Player chose: Do not respond","1 threat placed on The Break-In! (now 1).","Spider-Man draws 1 card(s).","Rhino attacks Spider-Man.","Player chose: Defend with ally Jessica Jones (exhaust; it takes all the damage, 2 HP left)","Boost card revealed: Hydra Mercenary (+1).","Rhino's attack has 3 ATK.","Jessica Jones takes 3 damage.","Jessica Jones is defeated.","Encounter card revealed: False Alarm (treachery).","Player chose: Do not respond","Spider-Man is confused.","--- End of round. Round 3 begins ---","--- Player turn, round 3 ---","Player chose: Use Avengers Mansion: draw 1 card (exhaust)","Spider-Man draws 1 card(s).","Player chose: Basic thwart: Spider-Man removes 1 threat from The Break-In! (exhaust Spider-Man) (you are confused: this only removes the confuse)","Spider-Man is confused: the thwart is replaced by discarding the confuse.","Player chose: Play Mockingbird, paying: discard G