t).","Player chose: Play Heroic Intuition, paying: discard Surveillance Team [mental]; discard Interrogation Room [energy]","Played Heroic Intuition.","Player chose: End your turn","Player chose: Done discarding; draw up to hand size","Player deck reshuffled; an encounter card is dealt to Spider-Man.","Spider-Man draws 4 card(s).","--- Villain phase, round 5 ---","1 threat placed on The Break-In! (now 3).","Spider-Man draws 1 card(s).","Rhino attacks Spider-Man.","Player chose: Defend with Spider-Man (exhaust; DEF 3 reduces the damage)","Boost card revealed: Crowd Control (+2).","Rhino's attack has 9 ATK.","Spider-Man defends, reducing the damage by 3.","Spider-Man takes 6 damage (2 HP left).","Encounter card revealed: Hard to Keep Down (treachery).","Player chose: Play Enhanced Spider-Sense, paying: use Web-Shooter [wild]","Played Enhanced Spider-Sense.","The When Revealed effect of Hard to Keep Down is cancelled.","Encounter card revealed: False Alarm (treachery).","Spider-Man is confused.","--- End of round. Round 6 begins ---","--- Player turn, round 6 ---","Player chose: Ally attack: Black Cat deals 1 damage to Rhino (exhaust; takes 0 consequential damage)","Black Cat attacks Rhino for 1.","Rhino takes 1 damage (4 HP left).","Player chose: Play Nick Fury, paying: discard Spider-Tracer [energy]; discard Daredevil [physical]; discard Webbed Up [physical]; discard The Power of Justice [wild]","Played Nick Fury.","Player chose: Deal 4 damage to an enemy","Player chose: Deal 4 damage to Rhino","Rhino takes 4 damage (0 HP left).","Rhino is defeated.","GAME OVER - victory: Rhino defeated"]}
