have Avengers Mansion and Helicarrier ready next turn so exhausting is totally fine."},{"round":3,"kind":"turn","key":"use:Avengers Mansion","reasoning":"Use Avengers Mansion to draw a card first."},{"round":3,"kind":"turn","key":"use:Helicarrier","reasoning":"Use Helicarrier to reduce next card cost by 1."},{"round":3,"kind":"turn","key":"play:Mockingbird|pay:Great Responsibility+Great Responsibility","reasoning":"Play Mockingbird (cost reduced to 2) paying with two Great Responsibility cards. She stuns Rhino!"},{"round":3,"kind":"choice","key":"effect:Mockingbird\u003eRhino","reasoning":"Stun Rhino."},{"round":3,"kind":"turn","key":"play:Swinging Web Kick\u003eRhino|pay:Surveillance Team+Tenacity+Webbed Up","reasoning":"Play Swinging Web Kick dealing 8 damage to Rhino! Paying with Webbed Up, Tenacity, Surveillance Team. Rhino will take 8 damage, dropping to 2 HP!"},{"round":3,"kind":"turn","key":"use:Surveillance Team","reasoning":"Use Surveillance Team to clear the threat on The Break-In! (1 down to 0)."},{"round":3,"kind":"choice","key":"effect:Surveillance Team\u003eThe Break-In!","reasoning":"Remove 1 threat from The Break-In!."},{"round":3,"kind":"turn","key":"attack:Mockingbird\u003eRhino","reasoning":"Mockingbird basic attacks Rhino for 1 damage (Rhino down to 1 HP). Ready to defeat stage 1 next round!"},{"round":3,"kind":"turn","key":"end_turn","reasoning":"End turn. Rhino is stunned so he won't attack! Keeping Spider-Man ready to ready up next round."},{"round":3,"kind":"discard","key":"discard:done","reasoning":"Done discarding; draw up to hand size (drawing 4 cards)."},{"round":4,"kind":"turn","key":"use:Avengers Mansion","reasoning":"Use Avengers Mansion to draw 1 card."},{"round":4,"kind":"turn","key":"use:Helicarrier","reasoning":"Use Helicarrier to reduce next card cost by 1."},{"round":4,"kind":"turn","key":"play:For Justice!\u003eBomb Scare|pay:Enhanced Spider-Sense","reasoning":"Play For Justice! on Bomb Scare, paying with Enhanced Spider-Sense (