d\u003eRhino","reasoning":"Mockingbird attacks Rhino for 1 damage."},{"round":1,"kind":"turn","key":"end_turn","reasoning":"End turn. Note: we hold Swinging Web Kick and Black Cat. Spider-Man hand size is 5, so we will draw 3 cards."},{"round":1,"kind":"discard","key":"discard:done","reasoning":"Keep Swinging Web Kick and Black Cat, draw up to 5."},{"round":2,"kind":"turn","key":"play:Nick Fury|pay:Black Cat+Genius+Webbed Up","reasoning":"Play Nick Fury, discarding Black Cat, Webbed Up, and Genius (2 resources). This keeps Swinging Web Kick in hand."},{"round":2,"kind":"choice","key":"effect:Nick Fury\u003edraw","reasoning":"Draw 3 cards with Nick Fury."},{"round":2,"kind":"turn","key":"thwart:Nick Fury\u003eThe Break-In!","reasoning":"Nick Fury thwarts 2 threat from The Break-In!"},{"round":2,"kind":"turn","key":"play:Web-Shooter|pay:Haymaker","reasoning":"Play Web-Shooter paying with Haymaker (keeping Backflip for villain attack defense)."},{"round":2,"kind":"turn","key":"attack:Spider-Man\u003eRhino","reasoning":"Spider-Man attacks Rhino for 2 damage (Rhino down to 9 HP)."},{"round":2,"kind":"turn","key":"attack:Mockingbird\u003eRhino","reasoning":"Mockingbird attacks Rhino for 1 damage (Rhino down to 8 HP). Mockingbird now has 1 HP left and can chump block if needed, or Nick Fury can chump block!"},{"round":2,"kind":"turn","key":"end_turn","reasoning":"End turn. We stay in Hero form so Rhino attacks, Nick Fury leaves at end of round (or wait, Nick Fury is discarded at the end of the round, so he won't be around during the villain phase! Nick Fury's card text says: \"Discarded at the end of the round.\" Round ends after villain phase! So Nick Fury is here for the villain phase to defend!). Wait, let's verify if we want to discard cards."},{"round":2,"kind":"discard","key":"discard:done","reasoning":"Keep Swinging Web Kick and Backflip, draw 3 up to hand size 5."},{"round":2,"kind":"window","key":"pass","reasoning":"Do not play Great Responsibility. 1 threat is fine."},{"round":2,"kind":"defend","key":"defend:Nick Fury","reasoning":"Defend with Nick Fury, who will be discarded at the end of the round anyway!"},{"round":2,"kind":"defend","key":"defend:none","reasoning":"Do not defend, we have Backflip in hand to cancel all damage if needed, keeping Mockingbird and Spider-Man ready!"},{"round":2,"kind":"window","key":"play:Backflip","reasoning":"Play Backflip to take 0 damage!"},{"round":3,"kind":"turn","key":"play:Swinging Web Kick\u003eRhino|pay:Interrogation Room+Strength","reasoning":"Play Swinging Web Kick on Rhino paying with Strength and Interrogation Room. Deals 8 damage, defeating Stage 1 Rhino!"},{"round":3,"kind":"turn","key":"play:For Justice!\u003eBreakin' \u0026 Takin'|pay:Great Responsibility+Web-Shooter(ability)","reasoning":"Play For Justice! targeting Breakin' \u0026 Takin', paying with Great Responsibility (mental, so removes 4 threat, clearing it entirely) and Web-Shooter."},{"round":3,"kind":"turn","key":"attack:Spider-Man\u003eRhino","reasoning":"Spider-Man attacks Rhino for 2 damage (13 HP left)."},{"round":3,"kind":"turn","key":"thwart:Mockingbird\u003eThe Break-In!","reasoning":"Mockingbird thwarts The Break-In! removing 1 threat (down to 1). Mockingbird is defeated by consequential damage."},{"round":3,"kind":"turn","key":"end_turn","reasoning":"End turn in Hero form (HP is 10/10, threat is at 1/7). We'll draw back up to 5 cards and ready."},{"round":3,"kind":"discard","key":"discard:done","reasoning":"Done discarding; keep Heroic Intuition or discard it? Actually let's just keep it and draw 4."},{"round":3,"kind":"defend","key":"defend:none","reasoning":"Do not defend; take the damage so Spider-Man stays ready. Rhino cannot defeat 10 HP."},{"round":4,"kind":"turn","key":"attack:Spider-Man\u003eRhino","reasoning":"Basic attack Rhino for 2 damage (11 HP left). Sandman does not have Guard, so we can attack Rhino!"},{"round":4,"kind":"turn","key":"play:Swinging Web Kick\u003eRhino|pay:For Justice!+Survei