der-Man draws up to 5."},{"round":4,"kind":"discard","key":"discard:Tenacity","reasoning":"Discard Tenacity (we don't need it right now)."},{"round":4,"kind":"discard","key":"discard:done","reasoning":"Done discarding; draw up to 5 cards."},{"round":4,"kind":"window","key":"pass","reasoning":"Do not respond. 1 threat on 0/7 is totally fine."},{"round":4,"kind":"defend","key":"defend:none","reasoning":"Do not defend: Spider-Man is at full 10 HP, and we want him ready next turn to deal 2 damage to Rhino."},{"round":4,"kind":"window","key":"play:Enhanced Spider-Sense|pay:Spider-Tracer","reasoning":"Play Enhanced Spider-Sense discarding Spider-Tracer to cancel The Vulture's Plans."},{"round":5,"kind":"turn","key":"use:Avengers Mansion","reasoning":"Draw 1 card with Avengers Mansion."},{"round":5,"kind":"turn","key":"attack:Black Cat\u003eRhino","reasoning":"Black Cat attacks Rhino for 1 damage (Rhino down to 8 HP)."},{"round":5,"kind":"turn","key":"play:Swinging Web Kick\u003eRhino|pay:Strength+Surveillance Team","reasoning":"Play Swinging Web Kick on Rhino for 8 damage! Rhino Stage 1 defeated! (Paying Strength + Surveillance Team)."},{"round":5,"kind":"turn","key":"use:Helicarrier","reasoning":"Use Helicarrier to reduce next card cost by 1."},{"round":5,"kind":"turn","key":"play:Web-Shooter","reasoning":"Play Web-Shooter for 0 cost."},{"round":5,"kind":"turn","key":"attack:Spider-Man\u003eRhino","reasoning":"Spider-Man basic attacks Rhino for 2 damage (Rhino stage 2 down to 13 HP)."},{"round":5,"kind":"turn","key":"change_form:Peter Parker","reasoning":"Change form to Peter Parker. We can heal with Aunt May next round, threat on main scheme is only 1/7, and Rhino stage 2 hits hard (ATK 3). In alter-ego, Rhino only schemes for 1."},{"round":5,"kind":"turn","key":"use:Aunt May","reasoning":"Use Aunt May to heal Peter Parker for 3 (up to max 10 HP)."},{"round":5,"kind":"turn","key":"end_turn","reasoning":"End turn. Hand has Great Responsibility, alter-ego hand size 6, so 