ackflip","reasoning":"Play Backflip to prevent all 3 damage!"},{"round":6,"kind":"window","key":"play:Enhanced Spider-Sense|pay:Emergency","reasoning":"Play Enhanced Spider-Sense discarding Emergency to cancel Advance! (Advance would scheme and potentially defeat us on 5/7 threat)."},{"round":6,"kind":"defend","key":"defend:Black Cat","reasoning":"Defend with Black Cat. Rhino hits for 3+boost, which would take Spider-Man down to ~4 HP with another encounter card still to resolve. Black Cat blocks the entire attack."},{"round":7,"kind":"turn","key":"use:Avengers Mansion","reasoning":"Draw 1 card with Avengers Mansion."},{"round":7,"kind":"turn","key":"attack:Spider-Man\u003eRhino","reasoning":"Basic attack Rhino to clear the stun status. (Exhausts Spider-Man). Note: Swinging Web Kick deals 8 damage, but if we played it while stunned, stun would cancel the attack and waste the card! So basic attack clears stun first."},{"round":7,"kind":"turn","key":"use:Helicarrier","reasoning":"Exhaust Helicarrier to reduce next card cost by 1."},{"round":7,"kind":"turn","key":"play:Swinging Web Kick\u003eRhino|pay:Spider-Tracer+Tenacity","reasoning":"Play Swinging Web Kick on Rhino for 8 damage! Paying Tenacity and Spider-Tracer (3 cost - 1 Helicarrier = 2 cost). Rhino takes 8 damage, down from 13 to 5 HP!"},{"round":7,"kind":"turn","key":"end_turn","reasoning":"End turn in Hero form so Rhino attacks (drawing a card via Spider-Sense) instead of scheming on 5/7 threat! We have 9 HP, DEF 3, and Web-Shooter ready. We draw 4 cards."},{"round":7,"kind":"discard","key":"discard:Interrogation Room","reasoning":"Discard Interrogation Room, then draw a fresh 5 cards!"},{"round":7,"kind":"defend","key":"defend:Spider-Man","reasoning":"Defend with Spider-Man (reduces damage by DEF 3). With 9 HP, this keeps us safe regardless of boost."},{"round":7,"kind":"window","key":"play:Enhanced Spider-Sense|pay:Web-Shooter(ability)","reasoning":"Cancel Hard to Keep Down using Enhanced Spider-Sense paid 